<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-17415] A node receives and resolves obsolete addresses from the previously restarted and killed nodes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17415</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Observation: Ignite tries to resolve &lt;b&gt;all&lt;/b&gt; known IP and DNS names exposed by the nodes since the cluster startup. This might cause a delay in response if DNS resolution takes some time and critical for Kubernetes envroments.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The issue is due to the ignite keeping track of the topology history.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
